{"availability":"available","full":"Jaderson-bit/mindmap-markmap-viewer","name":"mindmap-markmap-viewer","description":"A Claude Code skill that turns Markdown outlines into interactive, offline mind maps with markmap.js — white-on-dark, searchable (match + ancestors), with a zoom / expand / export toolbar.","category":"Productivity","language":"Python","stars":75,"forks":11,"created":"2026-06-07T21:54:42Z","updated":"2026-06-11T01:36:21Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":null,"topics":["claude","claude-code","claude-skill","markdown","markmap","mind-map","mindmap","skill","streamlit","visualization"],"demo":"https://jaderson-bit.github.io/mindmap-markmap-viewer/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:39.055Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:39.055Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:39.055Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:47:06.757Z","stars":74,"forks":11},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:06:39.055Z","stars":75,"forks":11}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Claude Code skill that turns hierarchical Markdown into an interactive SVG mind map with markmap.js — readable white-on-dark by default, with expand-by-level control and a search that filters the tree to matches plus their ancestors and descendants (so a hit always shows up in context, not floating alone). Works standalone or embedded in Streamlit.","▶ Live demo — an actual generated map, in your browser: pan, zoom, fold branches, export SVG/PNG. The page is one self-contained HTML file, exactly what the skill produces.","markmap renders a Markdown outline as a zoomable mind map, but three things need a layer on top to be genuinely usable:"],"features":["Visibility — a white font is invisible on the white default surface; the renderer paints its own dark backdrop so the map is readable everywhere, not just in a dark host.","Expand control — collapse to N levels or expand everything, without rebuilding the map.","Search that keeps context — filtering to just the matching nodes loses the path that explains where a hit lives; this keeps ancestors and the matched subtree.","One call to a single self-contained HTML file (buildhtml / writemindmap) — the markmap stack (vendored locally and pinned exact) is inlined into the page, so the one .html opens offline anywhere with no CDN, no network,…","Built-in navigation toolbar: zoom in/out, fit-to-window, expand-all / collapse-all, and export to SVG / PNG (2× raster, current fold state)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jaderson-bit/mindmap-markmap-viewer/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"7a5ff04a833d1011ac4116a30e7d49a715453994a6b8d2c8673ba9c070b75d52","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:06.869Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:06.869Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A Claude Code skill that turns hierarchical Markdown into an interactive SVG mind map with markmap.js — readable white-on-dark by default, with expand-by-level control and a search that filters the tree to matches plus their ancestors and descendants (so a hit always shows up in context, not floating alone). Works standalone or embedded in Streamlit.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jaderson-bit/mindmap-markmap-viewer/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"7a5ff04a833d1011ac4116a30e7d49a715453994a6b8d2c8673ba9c070b75d52","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jaderson-bit/mindmap-markmap-viewer/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:06.870Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-11T01:36:21Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jaderson-bit/mindmap-markmap-viewer/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:06.870Z","hash":"7a5ff04a833d1011ac4116a30e7d49a715453994a6b8d2c8673ba9c070b75d52","originalBytes":5189,"storedBytes":5189,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["skill","markmap","claude","expand","html","src","level","map","render","set","mindmap-markmap-viewer","assets","buil